WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:11.920
many are inquiring how am i to&nbsp;
make the surrender of myself to god&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:20.720
you desire to give yourself to him but you&nbsp;
are weak in moral power in slavery to doubt&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.320
and controlled by the habits of your life of sin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:32.880
your promises and resolutions are like ropes&nbsp;
of sand you cannot control your thoughts your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:41.040
impulses your affections the knowledge of your&nbsp;
broken promises and forfeited pledges weakens&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:47.280
your confidence in your own sincerity and&nbsp;
causes you to feel that god cannot accept you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:56.560
but you need not despair what you need to&nbsp;
understand is the true force of the will this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.560 --> 00:01:03.040
is the governing power in the nature of&nbsp;
man the power of decision or of choice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:10.720
everything depends on the right action of the&nbsp;
will the power of choice god has given to men&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:19.120
it is theirs to exercise you cannot&nbsp;
change your heart you cannot of yourself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:25.840
give to god its affections but you can choose&nbsp;
to serve him you can give him your will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:33.840
he will then work in you to will and to do&nbsp;
according to his good pleasure thus your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:40.240
whole nature will be brought under the control&nbsp;
of the spirit of christ your affections will be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:47.680
centered on him your thoughts will be in harmony&nbsp;
with him desires for goodness and holiness are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:55.840
right as far as they go but if you stop here&nbsp;
they will avail nothing many will be lost&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.480 --> 00:02:04.720
while hoping and desiring to be christians they do&nbsp;
not come to the point of yielding the will to god&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:13.280
they do not now choose to serve him through the&nbsp;
right exercise of the will an entire change may&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:20.960
be made in your life by yielding up the will to&nbsp;
christ you ally yourself with the power that is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:29.120
above all principalities and powers you will have&nbsp;
strength from above to hold you steadfast and thus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:44.080
through constant surrender to christ you will be&nbsp;
unable to live the new life even the life of faith

